      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je travaille au Centre Pokémon, je sais donc\nsoigner les blessures des Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nJ’ai voulu partager ce savoir avec mon équipe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai donc appris à mes Pokémon des capacités\nqui restaurent les PV !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A20190061006900200064006F006E00630020006100700070007200690073002000E00020006D0065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200064006500730020006300610070006100630069007400E90073000A007100750069002000720065007300740061007500720065006E00740020006C006500730020005000560020002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cela en fait des adversaires coriaces !\nÇa te dirait de te mesurer à eux ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Viens me parler quand tu voudras te battre\ncontre mon équipe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600690065006E00730020006D00650020007000610072006C006500720020007100750061006E006400200074007500200076006F007500640072006100730020007400650020006200610074007400720065000A0063006F006E0074007200650020006D006F006E002000E900710075006900700065002E00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, ça te dit d’affronter mon équipe\nde soigneurs ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F00720073002C002000E7006100200074006500200064006900740020006420190061006600660072006F006E0074006500720020006D006F006E002000E900710075006900700065000A0064006500200073006F00690067006E00650075007200730020003F00100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, c’est parti !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C002000632019006500730074002000700061007200740069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Une autre fois, peut-être !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E006500200061007500740072006500200066006F00690073002C00200070006500750074002D00EA007400720065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu fais bien de t’abstenir si tu ne te sens pas\nde taille, car tu risquerais de le regretter.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tes chances de victoire vont s’envoler dès que\nmes Pokémon vont se soigner !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quelle force ! Quelle ténacité !\nTu m’impressionnes !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750065006C006C006500200066006F007200630065002000210020005100750065006C006C00650020007400E9006E006100630069007400E900200021000A005400750020006D20190069006D007000720065007300730069006F006E006E006500730020002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je sais bien qu’on ne peut pas gagner en\ncomptant uniquement sur des capacités de soin.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe l’ai même pris en compte dans ma stratégie,\nmais cela ne m’a pas empêchée de perdre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 183
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’ai d’autre choix que de reconnaître ta force...\nainsi que mes propres faiblesses.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Après tout, je travaille au Centre Pokémon et ce\nque je fais de mieux, c’est soigner les Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et à propos de soins, je vais commencer par\nremettre d’aplomb mes Pokémon blessés !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça fait tout drôle, quand c’est mes propres\nPokémon que je dois soigner !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "« Merci d’avoir attendu.\nMon équipe a retrouvé la santé ! » Hi hi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00AB0020004D006500720063006900200064201900610076006F0069007200200061007400740065006E00640075002E000A004D006F006E002000E9007100750069007000650020006100200072006500740072006F0075007600E90020006C0061002000730061006E007400E900200021002000BB0020004800690020006800690020002100100002011401670000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bon, à présent je dois reprendre le travail.\nAhem... revenez nous voir quand vous voulez !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nNous serons ravis de soigner votre <U+0010><U+0003>ᄁý؇Pokémonéquipe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŧ",
